  > Employment in Nunavut increased moderately between 2024 and 2025, rising 1.4% (+200) to 14,500. A decline in public administration employment was offset by gains in utilities and educational services. | The Yukon had the strongest employment growth in 2025 of the three territories, up 2.3% (+600) from the previous year, with the largest gains in public administration.
